        "reason": "照会ノード(type1)は状態を変えないのでexitフレームとrollbackが不要。子のないuniteノードは誰にも観測されないので実行自体が不要。random入力では葉が多く、unite・履歴push・rollbackとスタック往復を減らせる見込み（未測定）。",
        "patch": "--- rollback_weighted_union_find_persistent_main.cpp\n-        const int state = uf.get_state();\n-        if (frame.vertex != 0) {\n-            const auto& query = queries[frame.vertex];\n-            if (query[0] == 0) uf.unite(query[1], query[2], std::int64_t{0});\n-            else answers[frame.vertex] = uf.same(query[1], query[2]);\n-        }\n-        stack.push_back({frame.vertex, state, true});\n+        const int first = head[frame.vertex];\n+        if (frame.vertex != 0) {\n+            const auto& query = queries[frame.vertex];\n+            if (query[0] != 0) answers[frame.vertex] = uf.same(query[1], query[2]);\n+            else {\n+                if (first == -1) continue;\n+                const int state = uf.get_state();\n+                uf.unite(query[1], query[2], std::int64_t{0});\n+                stack.push_back({frame.vertex, state, true});\n+            }\n+        }\n-        for (int child = head[frame.vertex]; child != -1; child = next[child]) stack.push_back({child, 0, false});\n+        for (int child = first; child != -1; child = next[child]) stack.push_back({child, 0, false});",
        "required_validation": "既存のPython独立モデルでsmall全照合。type1ノードを親に持つ入力、葉unite、k=-1のみ、を含めること。GCC/Clang両方でrandomと連続版の双方が現行3.203/3.078ms(g++)、3.105/2.917ms(clang++)から回帰しないこと。鎖状（葉がほぼ無い）入力でも悪化しないこと。"
